    "PhotoDel 不接入自己的云端服务，也不会把照片发到服务器。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoDel does not use its own cloud service and never sends photos to a server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoDel 支持者版": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoDel Supporter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoDel 是一个免费的相册整理小工具，目标是把删照片、归类照片这件事做得足够直接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoDel is a free photo cleanup tool built to make deleting and sorting photos feel direct."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PhotoDel 需要照片库权限来整理相册。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PhotoDel needs photo library access to organize your photos. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个免费的相册整理工具。滑动判断照片去留，完成后再统一确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A free photo cleanup tool. Swipe to decide what stays, then confirm everything at the end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上个月的照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
